		<item>
		<title>
		Comment on RENNtech is Building a Widebody Mercedes C126 with a 660 hp M120 V12 by R Bruce		</title>
		<link>https://engineswapdepot.com/?p=145020#comment-252666</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[R Bruce]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:39:29 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://engineswapdepot.com/?p=145020#comment-252666</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[The ultimate sleeper...a SWB 1989 300SE with MB M120 7.5L V12...HELL YEA! Peeps heads would spin off when you eat 911s and smoke the homies whips! The only tells would be the quad exhaust and the monoblock 18s. Light &#039;em up and let them eat dust!]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The ultimate sleeper&#8230;a SWB 1989 300SE with MB M120 7.5L V12&#8230;HELL YEA! Peeps heads would spin off when you eat 911s and smoke the homies whips! The only tells would be the quad exhaust and the monoblock 18s. Light &#8217;em up and let them eat dust!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>
		Comment on Mazda Miata with a 2.5 L MZR Inline-Four by Willis Hale		</title>
		<link>https://engineswapdepot.com/?p=150198#comment-252665</link>

		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Willis Hale]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 00:11:32 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://engineswapdepot.com/?p=150198#comment-252665</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[This is a bull ship article! Where are the performance stats? What was the before and after lap times? If I was doing a swap an LS of any stage would yield more performance. Frigging click bait!! Get a life or let AI Wright your dumb stories!!!]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This is a bull ship article! Where are the performance stats? What was the before and after lap times? If I was doing a swap an LS of any stage would yield more performance. Frigging click bait!! Get a life or let AI Wright your dumb stories!!!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
		
